        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni kūmala shiilī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū ja magesa ga ngano, ū Samsoni ūsola kabūli kasongi, ūja ū kū būkwiiye kūūnola ū nke wakwe. Aho washika ūhaya, “Naje ū mu maji ūmo, ū mulī nke wane.” Alīyo ū ise wa nkīma atanzunīlīgije ū kwingīla mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla, “Ū nene nakabona gīkī ī gete wankolilwe no, nūng'wihna ū nwani ng'wiyo ūyo walī nsheesha wako. Alīyo naaheene ūlībona kinehe ūlū kūnsola ū nzunaye, angū nīyo ū ng'wene wawiza kūtinda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Samsoni ūhaya gīkī, “Ū lūkangala ūlū natī na kabi ū kū Bafilisiti, bakūnibona nakūbagoloola dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūja kū masaka ūūkatega nyamhawa, ūjigwasha magana adatū; hūna ūjitunganīja ibīlī bīlī jiinhīla mikīla. Ī mikīla būbīlī wayo wīītunganīja hamò na līchenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlībacha moto ī līchenge, ūjilekela ī nyamhawa jenījo jūbbūmbūgala jijile sagala, mu migūnda ya shilīwa sha Bafilisiti shalī shitaalī mu malaale. Shūūjiga pye gete, īsho shalī shitaalī shīmīīlile, nī shisho shalī shabbutagūlwa shūlūndīkwa mu migūnda; pyī nī migūnda ya mizabibu, nī ya mizeituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti aho baabūūja gīkī, “Nani wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyū?” Būwīlwa, “Samsoni ū nkwīlīma wa mu Timuna; nguno wataajiwe ū nke, winhwa ū nwani ng'wiye ūyo walī nsheesha wakwe.” A Bafilisiti būnsanga ū nkīma ng'wenūyo nū ise, būbapemba mu moto būcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Samsoni nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Ūlū h'ūmo mulīītīla ūmu, naane natooya kūshisha namumalīle shiilī gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbasalīla kūbatūlagūla, būcha bingī no; hanuma wīnga ū kwenūko, ūja ūūkingīla ng'wihalo lyiwe lya Etamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbabūlaga Bafilisiti n'isaya lya nzobe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti būlinha bajile kū sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda, būūkatūūla ng'hambī yabo bbihī na Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda būbabūūja gīkī, “Ni kinehe ng'wiza kūtūdumīla?” Nabo būbawīla, “Twizaga kūnsola Samsoni tūntwaale tūkang'wītīle gīt'ūmo watwītīlile a bise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū banhū shihūmbī shidatū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda būja ū kwihalo lya kwiwe ī Etamu, būūkang'wīla ū Samsoni, “Bebe ūtamanile gīkī a Bafilisiti batūsugile? Watwītīlile mhayo kī ū gwenūyū?” Nang'hwe ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Ū nene naabīītile gīt'ūmo baanīītīlile dūhū a boi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būng'wīla, “Alilūūlū twizaga kūkūdima tūkakūtūūle mu makono gabo a Bafilisiti.” Nang'hwe ū Samsoni ūbawīla, “Niilahīlīlagi taame gīkī mutūnibūlaga a bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Būgatū a bise tūtūūkūbūlaga, tūkūkūtunga dūhū tūkūtwaale ū kūbo.” Hūna būntunga na ngoye ibīlī mhya, būntonja bantwaalile ū kūfuma ū kwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho beegeela ī Lehi, biza a Bafilisiti kūmanhya nang'hwe kūnū bakūyoganyaga. Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla na nguzu ningī. Ī ngoyī ījo jalī jitungilwe kū makono gaakwe jūbiza gītī būlūba būkūpyaga moto; īsho walī atungilwe ū mu makono gaakwe shūlagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbona iguha lyisaya lya nzobe lyalī lītaalī idoto, ūlīsola ūyūbatūla; ūbūlaga bagosha shihūmbī shimò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Samsoni wandya kūhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kūhaya ī gīko ūlīponya ī liguha lyisaya lya nzobe; ī lipandī lyenīlo linhwa lina lya Lamati-lehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lamati-lehi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, shigūlū sha maguha ga masaya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakolwa notà no, na lūūlū ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ū ntūmami wako wang'winhaga būtindi būtaale gīkī, hū nabūlagwe notà kūshisha nagwe mu makono ga banhū abo batasaalilwe aba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Lehi ng'wenūmo lyalīho ipandī itubīzu lya nyashimu, ū Mulungu ūtandūla ho gilonga minzī. Ū Samsoni aho wang'wa jūshoka ī nguzu jakwe ūdaama; ū lwinzī lwenūlo lwitanwa Eni-hakole,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eni-hakole:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, lwinzī lwa ng'witani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nī lelo lūlīho ī Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Samsoni akabatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī ū mu shikū ja Bafilisiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
